    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1206">

                <pb facs="0984" n="868" xml:id="pg868"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/5467.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Consul at Chihuahua to the Secretary of
                        State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Chihuahua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-11-11T12:00:00-07:04">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 11, 1912—12
                        noon</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Rebels have about 300 near railroad 50 miles north and about 200 in two or three
                    detachments in western part of State.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Letcher.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
